.title Todo Tools

.tool get_todo
.sqlc db/queries.sql GetTodo
.auth owner_id

Gets one of the caller's todos.

.tool finish_todo
.sqlc db/queries.sql SetTodoDone
.auth owner_id

Marks one of the caller's todos done or not done.

.tool list_todos
.sqlc ListTodos
.auth owner_id
.param done? "true" for done todos, "false" for open ones; leave it out for all.

Lists the caller's todos.

.tool search_todos
.sqlc db/search.sql
.auth owner_id
.param text The words to look for in titles.

Finds the caller's todos whose title contains the text.
